Package: visiumSpatialSolutions
Title: Tools for Spatial Analysis of Visium Spot-Based Arrays
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Eli", "Spies", , "eli.spies@charite.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-4071-4476"))
Description: This package provides helper functions for spatial analysis
    of Visium spot-based arrays, including validation of detected fiducial
    markers, conversion between array and pixel spot positions into
    spatial dimensions, spatially resolved visualization, and interactive
    spot selection within the spatially resolved image.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
